\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-1851456162\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-1851456162\" data-tab-index=\"2\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 2;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-1b0a357 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1b0a357\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ddb560 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0ddb560\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8964191 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8964191\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>sudo apt-get update<br \/>sudo apt-get install -y software-properties-common wget<br \/>sudo add-apt-repository -y universe<br \/>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/apt-stable\/24.04\/all\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br \/>sudo apt install -y .\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br \/>sudo apt-get update<br \/>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br \/>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br \/>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-1851456163\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-1851456163\" data-tab-index=\"3\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 3;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-3df6c44 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3df6c44\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ece761 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ece761\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fdec545 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fdec545\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y wget<br>sudo sed -i &#039;\/^deb\/ s\/$\/ contrib\/&#039; \/etc\/apt\/sources.list<br>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/apt-stable\/bookworm\/all\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt install -y .\/apt-ntop-stable.deb<br>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-1851456164\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-1851456164\" data-tab-index=\"4\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 4;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-9511e42 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9511e42\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e7c98f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2e7c98f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Rocky Linux 9 or AlmaLinux 9. On Rocky Linux 10, install redis first from another repository.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b2c43 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"79b2c43\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-edfbb4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"edfbb4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>curl -s https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/centos-stable\/ntop.repo | sudo tee \/etc\/yum.repos.d\/ntop.repo &gt; \/dev\/null<br>sudo dnf config-manager &#45;&#45;set-enabled crb<br>sudo dnf install -y epel-release<br>sudo dnf install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-1851456165\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-1851456165\" data-tab-index=\"5\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 5;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-54c5d71 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"54c5d71\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9c601c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a9c601c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>Raspberry Pi OS 64 bit (arm64). Stable and dev use the same packages.<\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c867b2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9c867b2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc2be68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fc2be68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>wget https:\/\/packages.ntop.org\/RaspberryPI\/apt-ntop.deb<br>sudo dpkg -i apt-ntop.deb<br>sudo apt-get update<br>sudo apt-get install -y ntopng<br>sudo systemctl stop ntopng<br>sudo ntopng -i eth1<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2eb7bea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2eb7bea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Replace eth1 with your interface name (run ip a). Stop ntopng with Ctrl+C.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d0b8360 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d0b8360\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Then open <b>http:\/\/YOUR-IP:3000<\/b>. Login: admin \/ admin.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce886b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ce886b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Next steps<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b9bf6d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7b9bf6d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d89569 elementor-widget elementor-widget-lte-button\" data-id=\"8d89569\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"lte-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lte-btn-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/quickstart\/ntopng-nprobe-netflow\/\"  class=\"lte-btn color-hover-default lte-icon-style-default\"><span class=\"lte-btn-inner\"><span class=\"lte-btn-before\"><\/span>Add NetFlow with nProbe<span class=\"lte-btn-after\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-360467b lte-btn-outline-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-lte-button\" data-id=\"360467b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"lte-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lte-btn-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/quickstart\/ntopng-cento-high-speed\/\"  class=\"lte-btn color-hover-default lte-icon-style-default\"><span class=\"lte-btn-inner